{
  "slug": "cooperator",
  "name": "Cooperator",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Allowing the agents of the same user or of the user teams to communicate between themselves while they are executing tasks. Imagine Slack, but for Claude agents.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `coop` (Automatically activate when claude-coop MCP tools (mcp__claude-coop__list_squad, mcp__claude-coop__send_message, etc.) are available) and **1 MCP server**, `claude-coop`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cooperator@claude-community` from `cooperbench/cooperator-plugin`.\n\nPeer messaging for Claude Code sessions. Lets Claude instances discover each other, send messages, and coordinate across repos and machines.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
